To import bookmarks:
Firefox:
1. Open Firefox
2. Press Ctrl+Shift+B to open Library
3. Click "Import and Backup" > "Import Bookmarks from HTML..."
4. Select the bookmark file from C:\Users\Public\Desktop\Bookmarks\
Chrome:
1. Open Chrome
2. Press Ctrl+Shift+O to open Bookmark Manager
3. Click the three dots menu > "Import bookmarks"
4. Select the Chrome bookmark file from C:\Users\Public\Desktop\Bookmarks\
Or use the desktop shortcut "{{ bookmark_title }}" to open directly.
